@startuml Manager Manage Showtime Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Thêm suất chiếu mới (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-showtimes.html" as UI
control "ShowtimeController" as Ctrl
entity "ShowtimeService" as Svc
entity "PricingService" as Pricing
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Chọn Phim, Phòng, Định dạng & Giờ bắt đầu
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/showtimes (ShowtimeRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: createShowtime(request)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findMovieById(movieId)
Svc -> DB: findRoomById(roomId)

note over Svc: Tính toán endTime = startTime + movie.duration

Svc -> DB: save(showtime)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: showtimeEntity
deactivate DB

Svc -> Pricing: calculateInitialPrices(showtime)
activate Pricing
Pricing --> Svc: success
deactivate Pricing

Svc --> Ctrl: showtimeResponseDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị thông báo & Cập nhật lịch chiếu
@enduml
